	(text_box "OCLO_IN = I_{IN} * R_{S} * (R_{F} / R_{G}) -> @ 0.1 A = 0.25 V, @ 2 A = 5 V\nV_{CM} = 24 V * (R_{F} / (R_{G} + R_{F})) ~= 23.53 V\nR_{s} Power dissipation = 0.05 * 2 A * 2 A = 0.2 W"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
